#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:1 9624effa704a472cb2e5a8d88c92158f
msgid "run_kfold.sh 脚本参考"
msgstr "run_kfold.sh Script Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:3 e94aba745d7d4ecbaebcebd48bbcfc33
msgid ""
"`scripts/run_kfold.sh` 是 UniKT 提供的轻量级 Shell 驱动脚本，用于自动化执行单模型或全模型库在指定 K "
"折上的连续训练与评测。"
msgstr ""
"`scripts/run_kfold.sh` is a lightweight Shell driver script provided by "
"UniKT for automating continuous training and evaluation across specified "
"K folds for a single model or the entire model zoo."

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:5 dff0667dbe6b49169260bc0797445474
msgid "基本语法"
msgstr "Basic Syntax"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:7 0290facc52b9409394eea89b31ef9dca
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh <model_name|ALL> <folds_list> [ARGS...]\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l | --list\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh <model_name|ALL> <folds_list> [ARGS...]\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l | --list\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:12 fd26e7c623694db1ba92031c8636f2ba
msgid "参数与选项"
msgstr "Parameters and Options"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md cc1a0774da564f78887df4f255a8f289
msgid "参数 / 选项"
msgstr "Parameter / Option"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 501538acb38e434fa51b00f80cb462dc
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md f568c37832a4491d9022bd864d94f03d
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 932e83225d384ea0b91cae16f5074a12
msgid "`model_name`"
msgstr "`model_name`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 0bdfc22dd79e48ed85de22cfc8530283
msgid "指定单一已注册模型名称，或传入 `ALL` 针对框架中所有已发现的模型执行跑批"
msgstr ""
"Specify a single registered model name, or pass `ALL` to run batch "
"execution across all discovered models in the framework"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 28555d05874a460fa94092a12be76ff8
msgid "`GIKT`, `AKT`, `ALL`"
msgstr "`GIKT`, `AKT`, `ALL`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 14b62d2d1eac44e38e3d785047b7cf98
msgid "`folds_list`"
msgstr "`folds_list`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 7adc5ad6a6b74ecea93224141aa4ea2c
msgid "待运行的折索引序列，支持空格分隔（加引号）或逗号分隔"
msgstr ""
"Sequence of fold indices to run, supporting space-separated (enclosed in "
"quotes) or comma-separated formats"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 88286c665e1749c29c223deec622ddc4
msgid "`\"0 1 2 3 4\"` 或 `\"0,1,2,3,4\"`"
msgstr "`\"0 1 2 3 4\"` or `\"0,1,2,3,4\"`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md b909f1d5e0a64044865e1680e7b6fcd9
msgid "`ARGS...`"
msgstr "`ARGS...`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 15080453854f48c78c8680cd2dcb201f
msgid "透传给底层 `train.py` 的额外参数（例如数据集 `-d`、轮数 `--model.epochs` 等）"
msgstr ""
"Extra parameters passed through to the underlying `train.py` (e.g., "
"dataset `-d`, epochs `--model.epochs`, etc.)"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md edc9ac3b47884e4696d68514bd591d47
msgid "`-d assistments09 --model.epochs 100`"
msgstr "`-d assistments09 --model.epochs 100`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 1847f104583f473284e58e0324c1f6ee
msgid "`-l, --list`"
msgstr "`-l, --list`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md 08d0c74c0cb24f98b915bb695b0e07f3
msgid "打印当前框架中所有通过 AST 静态扫描发现的模型列表并退出"
msgstr ""
"Print the list of all models discovered via AST static scanning in the "
"current framework and exit"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md f7e1f500cd77440db18dbc2aa9454859
msgid "`bash scripts/run_kfold.sh --list`"
msgstr "`bash scripts/run_kfold.sh --list`"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:23 5961fe8a5c4d4512beec01b9a04514af
msgid "核心机制"
msgstr "Core Mechanisms"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:25 13a3664fb7b24eb2bd6e783806eb39d0
msgid "**AST 零开销静态模型发现**： 脚本通过调用 Python 内部的静态 AST 扫描程序列出所有模型："
msgstr ""
"**Zero-Overhead AST Static Model Discovery**: The script calls Python's "
"internal static AST scanner to list all models:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:27 aacf2bfb5b67496995f528e4968b88f0
msgid ""
"python -c \"import model; from utils.core.registry import TRAINERS; "
"print(' '.join(sorted(TRAINERS.keys())))\"\n"
msgstr ""
"python -c \"import model; from utils.core.registry import TRAINERS; "
"print(' '.join(sorted(TRAINERS.keys())))\"\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:30 8aae26490bca49dfaf77277c06ac5e61
msgid "该过程无需实际导入庞大的 PyTorch 权重或依赖库，可在任何环境中毫秒级响应。"
msgstr ""
"This process does not require importing large PyTorch weights or "
"dependency libraries, responding in milliseconds in any environment."

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:31 84292f72edcb42caa7251d79847386c6
msgid ""
"**错误阻断机制**： 在循环执行各折时，若某一折因异常退出（退出码非 "
"0），脚本将立即中断退出，并向终端返回该折的错误码，防止静默失败或在错误的配置下空跑算力。"
msgstr ""
"**Error Interruption Mechanism**: When executing folds in a loop, if any "
"fold exits abnormally (non-zero exit code), the script immediately "
"aborts, returning the fold's error code to the terminal to prevent silent"
" failures or wasted compute on erroneous configurations."

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:33 c646da4ecffe4b36b2756316816b8d1e
msgid ""
"**解释器环境注入**： 脚本默认使用当前环境的 `python` 命令。若需使用特定环境管理器（如 Pixi），可通过环境变量 `PYTHON`"
" 进行覆盖："
msgstr ""
"**Interpreter Environment Injection**: The script defaults to the "
"`python` command in the current environment. If a specific environment "
"manager (such as Pixi) is required, it can be overridden via the `PYTHON`"
" environment variable:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:35 87f6f7d76599460bb6f877927c92689c
msgid ""
"PYTHON=\"pixi run python\" bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1\" -d "
"assistments09\n"
msgstr ""
"PYTHON=\"pixi run python\" bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1\" -d "
"assistments09\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:41 0a67007dbabc4e72bdfd91350ee6f78b
msgid "常用命令示例"
msgstr "Common Command Examples"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:43 2b083edbb66d439081b385b3a687c5d1
msgid "1. 查阅所有支持的模型"
msgstr "1\\. Check All Supported Models"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:44 dd0209e61593416f853032ac4b6fe4e4
msgid "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh --list\n"
msgstr "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh --list\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:48 b229415920e24674bbe5c2a61583d7fe
msgid "2. 对单一模型执行标准 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "2\\. Run Standard 5-Fold Cross-Validation on a Single Model"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:49 2cba9660c72248d1b289132d8d4597d6
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" \\\n"
"    -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --model.epochs 150 \\\n"
"    --model.batch_size 128\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" \\\n"
"    -d assistments09 \\\n"
"    --model.epochs 150 \\\n"
"    --model.batch_size 128\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:56 1e86fba2bf174cd29f55dc7b209e52ea
msgid "3. 执行特定两折的快速验证"
msgstr "3\\. Run Quick Validation on Specific Two Folds"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:57 fc771dad4ba84e94b5ce3f12f9f321df
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh AKT \"0,1\" -d ednet_kt1 --model.learning_rate "
"0.0005\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh AKT \"0,1\" -d ednet_kt1 --model.learning_rate "
"0.0005\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:61 0b3b474a1e1d4534bd7176bf6383fd97
msgid "4. 批量运行全量模型基准评测"
msgstr "4\\. Batch Run Full Model Zoo Benchmark Evaluation"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:62 545a8a7677914e9fb56cd757d4f166b2
msgid "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh ALL \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09\n"
msgstr "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh ALL \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/run-kfold.md:65 f56d278ee5304683a9acf7d172e8e58a
msgid "此时脚本将依次遍历框架内置的所有知识追踪模型，为每个模型连续完成 5 折训练。"
msgstr ""
"The script will sequentially iterate over all built-in knowledge tracing "
"models in the framework, completing 5-fold training consecutively for "
"each model."
